<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna bourse halts trading on technical glitch.</title>
<headline>Vienna bourse halts trading on technical glitch.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna stock exchange said on Tuesday trading on its EQOS electronic share trading system was suspended until further notice because of technical difficulties. The market was due to open at 0830 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
